  - "cross-sectional transformer"
  - "quantitative finance"
  - "machine learning"

abstract: >
  AlphaPolicy is a reproducible two-stage multi-asset research system.
  Stage A (AlphaModel) produces discrete predictive return distributions and
  an expected-return signal (mu). Stage B (PolicyModel) maps cached alpha
  summaries to daily portfolio weights using a cross-sectional Transformer and
  a differentiable objective with costs and constraints (e.g., turnover and
  diversification controls). Research software; not investment advice.

